  "description": "Fun play = No ❌RESTRICTIONS❌ EVER for anything. \n\n• Exception - inactivity.🚷\n\n☑️ Once you’ve been checked offline more than 3 days you’ll be kicked to get free space for new players who just want to play for fun. \n\n\nIn other cases, there are no RESTRICTIONS. That means you are absolutely free to do whatever you want to do while you are in this guild.\n\n👾Discord channel: \n\nhttps://discord.gg/2GEswsgbc\n\nThis guild is probably the best way to try yourself like guild member and decide if you wanna be stay independent or even join top guilds. \n\n✅Guild est. 09.21.2024",
